  "question": {
    "text": "A piston filled with 0.04 mol of an ideal gas expands reversibly from 50.0 mL to 375 mL&nbsp;at a constant temperature of <math> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mn>7</mn> <mo>.</mo> <msup> <mn>0</mn> <mo>&#8728;</mo> </msup> <mtext>C</mtext></mrow></math>. As it does so, it absorbs 208 J of heat. The values of q and w for the process will be&nbsp;<br />(R = 8.314 J/mol K) (ln7.5 = 2.01)"
  },
